WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.520
A short piece of documentation can get
padded with phrases that add very little.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.546
The agent writes the description.

3
00:00:09.546 --> 00:00:13.643
Deslop’s local check flags a
filler phrase in the write result.

4
00:00:13.643 --> 00:00:18.520
The agent keeps what the sentence says
and drops the words that delayed it.

5
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.965
Keep the wording that helps the reader.

6
00:00:28.965 --> 00:00:34.160
When a phrase adds nothing to the claim,
the shorter sentence is easier to use.
